@host = http://localhost:5033

### Create a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-1",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "TicketCreated",
  "status": "Open",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T10:00:00Z",
  "customerId": "Acme Ltd",
  "subject": "Cannot log in"
}

### Change status
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-2",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T10:05:00Z"
}

### Duplicate eventId -> 200, "duplicate": true, no change
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-2",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T10:05:00Z"
}

### Created again for an existing ticket (new eventId) -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-4",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "TicketCreated",
  "status": "Open",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T10:10:00Z",
  "customerId": "Acme Ltd",
  "subject": "Cannot log in"
}

### Resolve the ticket
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-5",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "Resolved",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T12:00:00Z"
}

### Stale event (older occurredAt) -> 200, status stays Resolved
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-6",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T11:00:00Z"
}

### Missing fields (no eventId, no occurredAt) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Invalid status -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/ticket-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-3",
  "ticketId": "T-100",
  "type": "StatusChanged",
  "status": "Banana",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-27T10:06:00Z"
}

### Get ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/T-100
Accept: application/json
